WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.545
A professional value hypothesis does not promise savings.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:11.520
It names the person served, the work, the comparison baseline, what to measure, and who checks the result.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.951
Record uncertainty and what would make you change your decision.

00:00:15.951 --> 00:00:23.484
Save the AI-role table and the value hypothesis in the same continuing project you have been building.
